 /*MAP of PINS

PA1-> buttons with differend resistors(adc)
3.3V
 |
[10k]
 |
 +-------> PA1 / ADC_BUTTONS
 |
 +--[ MODE]--[1k]--GND
 |
 +--[ SET ]--[2k]--GND
 |
 +--[ UP  ]--[4.7k]--GND
 |
 +--[ DOWN]--[10k]--GND
 |
 +--[ OFF ]--[20k]--GND

PA0-> light sensor(adc)
3.3V
 |
[LDR]
 |
 +-------> PA0 / ADC_LIGHT
 |
[10k]
 |
GND

74HC595N wiring:
PA2 -> SER / DS / pin 14
PA4 -> SRCLK / SH_CP / pin 11
PA3 -> RCLK / ST_CP / pin 12
PA6 -> OE / pin 13
3.3V -> MR / SRCLR / pin 10
3.3V -> VCC / pin 16
GND -> GND / pin 8

DS1302Z wiring:
PA5 -> CLK
PA7 -> DATA / I/O
PA8 -> RST / CE
3.3V -> VCC
GND -> GND

HW-481 / DHT11 wiring:
PA10 -> DATA / S
5V -> VCC / +
GND -> GND / -

Active buzzer wiring:
PA15 -> NPN base through 1k..4.7k
3.3V -> 270R -> buzzer +
buzzer - -> NPN collector
NPN emitter -> GND

Second 74HC595N is chained from first register QH' to second register DS.

Board 1 outputs:
QA -> hours 32
QB -> hours 16
QC -> hours 8
QD -> hours 4
QE -> hours 2
QF -> hours 1
QG -> minutes 32
QH -> minutes 16

Board 2 outputs:
QA -> minutes 8
QB -> minutes 4
QC -> minutes 2
QD -> minutes 1
QE -> mode hours
QF -> mode date
QG -> mode environment
QH -> alarm set
Brightness:
PA0 light sensor controls brightness from 5% to 70%.
All Q0-Q7 outputs are enabled with the same brightness through OE dimming.
 */

